  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into wedges and place on the lined oven tray.<br>• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt.<br>• Toss to coat and bake until tender, 20-25 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f846a2cade9b9f0ace0d97/step-7d882500.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, grate carrot and zucchini. Drain sweetcorn. Squeeze excess moisture out of carrot and zucchini using a paper towel or clean cloth.<br>• In a medium bowl, combine carrot, zucchini, sweetcorn, Cheddar cheese, the plain flour, egg, milk and all-purpose seasoning.<br>• Lift out some of the mixture with a spoon, if it’s too wet and doesn’t hold its shape, add more flour.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f846a2cade9b9f0ace0d97/step-7e154f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat <br>the base.<br>• When oil is hot, cook fritters in batches, flattening each with a spatula, until golden, 3-4 mins each side. (Don&#39;t flip the fritters too early to ensure they set.)<br>• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f846a2cade9b9f0ace0d97/step-184b2a20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato.<br>• In a second medium bowl, combine the mayonnaise and honey with a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Add tomato and salad leaves. Toss to coat and season withh salt and pepper.<br>• Divide fritters, wedges and garden salad between plates.<br>• Drizzle with sweet chilli sauce to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f846a2cade9b9f0ace0d97/step-bb8c5130.jpg"
    }
  ]
